    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prolog">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEm">I Em</ref> Prolog</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eadmund cyngc gesamnode micelne sinoð to Lundenbirig on ða halgan easterlican tíd ægðer ge godcundra háda ge worldcundra; ðar wæs Òda arcebiscop ⁊ Wulfstan arcebiscop ⁊ manega oðre biscopas smeagende ymbon heora sawla ræd ⁊ þara þe him underþeodde wæron.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">King Edmund has convened at London, during the holy season of Easter, a great assembly both of the ecclesiastical and secular estates. Archbishop Oda and Archbishop Wulfstan and many other bishops have there been taking counsel for the welfare of their [own] souls and [the souls] of those who have been placed under their charge.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eadmund cyning gesomnode mycelne sinoð to Lundebyrig on ða halgan easterlicon tid ægðer ge godcundra hada ge woroldcundra: ðar hwæs Oda ⁊ Wulfstan arcebiscop ⁊ mænige oðre biscopas smeagende ymbe heora saula ræd ⁊ ðara ðe him underðeodde wæron.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
